{"id":4680,"date":"2025-07-22T10:30:43","date_gmt":"2025-07-22T10:30:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4680"},"modified":"2025-08-28T09:25:06","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T02:25:06","slug":"lemon-digital-duoc-shopee-vinh-danh-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/su-kien\/lemon-digital-duoc-shopee-vinh-danh-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Lemon Digital \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee vinh danh &#8220;Best Enabler Of The Year&#8221; 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>N\u0103m 2025 \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ea7y t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital, khi ch\u00fang t\u00f4i vinh d\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00ean t\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Shopee Brands x Creators Conference 2025 \u1edf h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c danh gi\u00e1 nh\u1ea5t: &#8220;Best Enabler Of The Year \u2013 \u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ee7a n\u0103m&#8221;. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 minh ch\u1ee9ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng nh\u1ea5t cho nh\u1eefng n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9, n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i v\u00e0 cam k\u1ebft s\u00e2u s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 Lemon trong vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t &#8220;l\u00ean s\u1ed1&#8221; m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u Shopee. C\u00f9ng <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.store\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a><\/span> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1o n\u00ean th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng n\u00e0y v\u00e0 tri\u1ebft l\u00fd &#8220;Build to Sell&#8221; \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00fap ch\u00fang t\u00f4i tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4691\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4691\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4691\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/142.png\" alt=\"Shopee Award l\u00e0 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u00e0ng n\u0103m\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/142.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/142-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/142-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/142-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/142-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4691\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Shopee Award l\u00e0 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u00e0ng n\u0103m<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2><strong>1.\u00a0Th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng Th\u01b0\u01a1ng M\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec7n T\u1eed Vi\u1ec7t Nam &#8211; Cu\u1ed9c \u0111ua kh\u1ed1c li\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c Enabler<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111ang trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng nhanh ch\u00f3ng, v\u1edbi t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 trung b\u00ecnh 25%\/n\u0103m t\u1eeb 2020-2025. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, Shopee hi\u1ec7n \u0111ang chi\u1ebfm g\u1ea7n 60% th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c c\u1ea1nh tranh kh\u1ed1c li\u1ec7t gi\u1eefa h\u00e0ng tr\u0103m \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n TM\u0110T (Ecommerce Enabler) \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u00ean c\u00e1c s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn. C\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111ang c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ecbch m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd sang vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i s\u1ed1 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch, khi\u1ebfn Ecommerce Enabler tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u1eaft x\u00edch kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu. Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh \u0111\u00f3, vi\u1ec7c t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u1ea5u hi\u1ec3u ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch h\u00e0nh vi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0a ra gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n l\u00e0 v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2><strong>2. H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ki\u1ebfn t\u1ea1o gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital &#8211; T\u1eeb kh\u1edfi nguy\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ec9nh vinh quang<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4690\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4690\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4690\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/141.png\" alt=\"Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng vun \u0111\u1eafp gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi v\u00e0 b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/141.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/141-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/141-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/141-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/141-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4690\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng vun \u0111\u1eafp gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi v\u00e0 b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb n\u0103m 2020, kh\u1edfi ngu\u1ed3n t\u1eeb kh\u00e1t v\u1ecdng c\u1ee7a hai nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng l\u1eadp tr\u1ebb. Ch\u1ec9 sau 5 n\u0103m th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 g\u1ed3m 60 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, tri\u1ec3n khai h\u01a1n 500 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 mang l\u1ea1i doanh thu h\u00e0ng tr\u0103m t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng m\u1ed7i n\u0103m cho nhi\u1ec1u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n l\u1ebb t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng &#8220;Best Enabler Of The Year&#8221; t\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Shopee Brands x Creators Conference 2025 \u2013 h\u1ed9i ngh\u1ecb th\u01b0\u1eddng ni\u00ean l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a Shopee d\u00e0nh cho c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt \u2013 l\u00e0 danh hi\u1ec7u cao nh\u1ea5t d\u00e0nh cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh. Gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean nhi\u1ec1u ti\u00eau ch\u00ed kh\u1eaft khe, bao g\u1ed3m t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu, hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c tri\u1ec3n khai v\u00e0 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh qu\u1ea3 n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1ea3i qua m\u1ed9t n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u1ea7y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chu\u1ed7i h\u1ea1ng V\u00e0ng li\u00ean ti\u1ebfp trong nhi\u1ec1u th\u00e1ng v\u00e0 hai l\u1ea7n ch\u1ea1m \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed1c Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng \u2013 c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 cao nh\u1ea5t trong h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng x\u1ebfp h\u1ea1ng Enabler c\u1ee7a Shopee. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c th\u1ef1c chi\u1ebfn v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4688\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4688\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4688\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/139.png\" alt=\"Kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc c\u00f9ng nhau r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1 check-in tr\u01b0\u1edbc qu\u1ea7y booth Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/139.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/139-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/139-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/139-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/139-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4688\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc c\u00f9ng nhau r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1 check-in tr\u01b0\u1edbc qu\u1ea7y booth Lemon Digital<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2><strong>3. Tri\u1ebft l\u00fd &#8220;Build to Sell&#8221; &#8211; N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng cho s\u1ef1 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>B\u00ed quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1eb1ng sau nh\u1eefng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital n\u1eb1m \u1edf tri\u1ebft l\u00fd v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o: &#8220;Build to Sell&#8221;. Anh T\u00f4 Tu\u1ea5n T\u00e0i, Founder &amp; CEO c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital, chia s\u1ebb: &#8220;Thay v\u00ec ch\u1ea1y theo chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch ng\u1eafn h\u1ea1n, Lemon ch\u1ecdn h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111i b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, h\u00e0nh vi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n \u2013 n\u1ec1n m\u00f3ng t\u1ea1o \u0111\u00f2n b\u1ea9y cho s\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n v\u00e0 ni\u1ec1m tin t\u1eeb h\u00e0ng tr\u0103m th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn nh\u1ecf&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Tri\u1ebft l\u00fd n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng l\u1ed9 tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, n\u00e2ng cao gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai. Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital lu\u00f4n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i: &#8220;L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u00fang h\u01b0\u1edbng, \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng?&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4686\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4686\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4686\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/137.png\" alt=\"Tri\u1ebft l\u00fd &quot;Build to Sell&quot; kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 kim ch\u1ec9 nam trong t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/137.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/137-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/137-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/137-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/137-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4686\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Tri\u1ebft l\u00fd &#8220;Build to Sell&#8221; kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 kim ch\u1ec9 nam trong t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2><strong>4. H\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p Th\u01b0\u01a1ng M\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec7n T\u1eed to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>T\u1eeb tri\u1ebft l\u00fd &#8220;Build to Sell&#8221;, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf m\u1ed9t h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 12 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u v\u00e0 to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n. \u0110i\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 Lemon Digital x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1eebng gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p ri\u00eang theo \u0111\u1eb7c th\u00f9 c\u1ee7a m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng, n\u01a1i h\u00e0nh vi mua v\u00e0 k\u00eanh chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t r\u00f5 n\u00e9t. C\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y bao g\u1ed3m:<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng E-commerce \u0111a s\u00e0n.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Setup gian h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng (n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba &amp; qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf).<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh E-commerce \u0111a s\u00e0n (Shopee, Lazada, TikTok Shop, Amazon).<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 T\u1ed1i \u01b0u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (Ecommerce Ads, TikTok Ads).<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung video \u0111a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Livestream chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 thu\u00ea studio, host livestream.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Booking KOL\/KOC v\u00e0 Affiliate.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p kho v\u1eadn v\u00e0 h\u1eadu c\u1ea7n (Ecommerce Fulfillment Solution).<\/p>\n<p>Lemon Digital l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ee7a h\u01a1n 300 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng \u0111a d\u1ea1ng nh\u01b0 th\u1eddi trang, \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, th\u1ef1c ph\u1ea9m, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m, gia d\u1ee5ng, m\u1eb9 &amp; b\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4684\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4684\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4684\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/135.png\" alt=\"Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ebfn t\u1ea1o th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh \u2013 c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc \u2013 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee7 s\u1ee9c b\u1eadt tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/135.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/135-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/135-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/135-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/135-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4684\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lemon Digital \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ebfn t\u1ea1o th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh \u2013 c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc \u2013 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee7 s\u1ee9c b\u1eadt tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ed1.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2><strong>5. Nh\u1eefng con s\u1ed1 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ch\u1ee9ng minh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 th\u1ef1c chi\u1ebfn<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4692\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4692\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4692\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/35.png\" alt=\"N\u0103m 2025 \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c \u0111\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/35.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/35-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/35-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/35-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/35-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4692\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">N\u0103m 2025 \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c \u0111\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>C\u00e1ch ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i \u1edf l\u00fd thuy\u1ebft m\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ee9ng minh b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng con s\u1ed1 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 v\u00e0 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong n\u0103m 2024:<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 tri\u1ec3n khai h\u01a1n 250 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed tr\u00ean nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch &#8220;Super Lemon Day&#8221; tr\u00ean Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t v\u00ed d\u1ee5 \u0111i\u1ec3n h\u00ecnh cho hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i, khi \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c 149% ch\u1ec9 ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 ra, v\u1edbi t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ho\u00e0n v\u1ed1n (ROI) l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 20 l\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u GEARVN trong ng\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1eeb 1.61% l\u00ean 3.34%, doanh thu g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 g\u1ea5p \u0111\u00f4i v\u00e0 ROAS v\u01b0\u1ee3t chu\u1ea9n ng\u00e0nh.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Shegan ghi nh\u1eadn t\u0103ng g\u1ea5p 3 l\u1ea7n t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i sau 1 n\u0103m \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng Lemon Digital.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Trong ng\u00e0nh th\u1eddi trang, gian h\u00e0ng Polomanor tr\u00ean Shopee \u0111\u00e3 t\u0103ng s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb 24.133 l\u00ean 27.414 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (CR) t\u0103ng t\u1eeb 1.75% l\u00ean 7.76% t\u1eeb th\u00e1ng 1\/2024 \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00e1ng 1\/2025.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi gian h\u00e0ng ChaChing tr\u00ean Shopee, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 ROAS (Return On Ad Spend) t\u1eeb 2.34 (th\u00e1ng 10\/2024) l\u00ean 7.32 (th\u00e1ng 12\/2024).<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 Hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111a s\u00e0n c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n qua c\u00e1c s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u GMV (Gross Merchandise Volume) t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean Shopee, Lazada v\u00e0 TikTok Shop qua c\u00e1c th\u00e1ng trong n\u0103m 2024 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7u 2025, v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c doanh thu v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u0103ng \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p>\u2022 D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Livestream c\u0169ng ch\u1ee9ng minh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 khi m\u1ed9t case study ng\u00e0nh m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m &amp; th\u1eddi trang ghi nh\u1eadn s\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u0103ng t\u1eeb 417 l\u00ean 9497 v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i t\u0103ng t\u1eeb 2.55% l\u00ean 6.01% t\u1eeb th\u00e1ng 1\/2024 \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00e1ng 12\/2024.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4693\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4693\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4693\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/41.png\" alt=\"Kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vinh danh \u2013 H\u01a1n c\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng, l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/41.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/41-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/41-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/41-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/41-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4693\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vinh danh \u2013 H\u01a1n c\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng, l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Nh\u1eefng con s\u1ed1 n\u00e0y l\u00e0 minh ch\u1ee9ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng cho vi\u1ec7c Lemon Digital kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u &#8220;b\u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u00e0ng&#8221; m\u00e0 c\u00f2n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h1><strong>6. &#8220;Best Enabler Of The Year&#8221; t\u1eeb Shopee &#8211; V\u1ecb th\u1ebf d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u &amp; T\u1ea7m nh\u00ecn cho t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai<\/strong><\/h1>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4687\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4687\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4687\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/138.png\" alt=\"Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng v\u1eefng v\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c cu\u1ed9c h\u00e0nh t\u00ecnh cho ch\u1eb7ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/138.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/138-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/138-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/138-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/138-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4687\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng v\u1eefng v\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c cu\u1ed9c h\u00e0nh t\u00ecnh cho ch\u1eb7ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>V\u1edbi danh hi\u1ec7u &#8220;Best Enabler Of The Year&#8221; t\u1eeb Shopee, Lemon Digital kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o h\u00e0ng ng\u0169 nh\u1eefng t\u00ean tu\u1ed5i d\u1eabn d\u1eaft xu h\u01b0\u1edbng trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ef1c m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd \u0111\u1ec3 Lemon cam k\u1ebft ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p TM\u0110T \u2013 t\u1eeb Livestream, Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, V\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, Fulfillment cho \u0111\u1ebfn T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng TM\u0110T \u2013 nh\u1eb1m gi\u00fap c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ee9t t\u1ed1c m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u01a1n n\u1eefa trong n\u0103m 2025 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng n\u0103m ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4685\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4685\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4685\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/136.png\" alt=\"T\u1eeb vinh quang h\u00f4m nay, Lemon Digital v\u1eefng v\u00e0ng vi\u1ebft ti\u1ebfp h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 ng\u00e0y mai.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/136.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/136-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/136-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/136-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/136-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4685\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1eeb vinh quang h\u00f4m nay, Lemon Digital v\u1eefng v\u00e0ng vi\u1ebft ti\u1ebfp h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 ng\u00e0y mai.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>S\u1ee9 m\u1ec7nh c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital l\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c Th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u00edch th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. S\u1ef1 ghi nh\u1eadn t\u1eeb Shopee c\u0169ng g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n n\u00e2ng cao ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh k\u00eanh online chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p cho nhi\u1ec1u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t. Lemon Digital s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c chia s\u1ebb ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c TM\u0110T \u0111\u1ec3 nhi\u1ec1u doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f9ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, ch\u1eafp c\u00e1nh tinh hoa v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t v\u01b0\u01a1n t\u1ea7m qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf qua th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed xuy\u00ean bi\u00ean gi\u1edbi.<\/p>\n<p>H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f2n d\u00e0i, nh\u01b0ng Lemon Digital lu\u00f4n s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng &#8220;chi\u1ebfn&#8221; c\u00f9ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u2013 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng, m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 TM\u0110T Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c.<\/p>\n<p>Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 Lemon Digital ngay h\u00f4m nay \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed Shopee!<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735 &#8211; 1900 636 099<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Email: <\/strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Website: <\/strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>N\u0103m 2025 \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ea7y t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a Lemon Digital, khi ch\u00fang t\u00f4i vinh d\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00ean t\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Shopee Brands x Creators Conference 2025 \u1edf h\u1ea1ng m\u1ee5c danh gi\u00e1 nh\u1ea5t: &#8220;Best Enabler Of The Year \u2013 \u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ee7a n\u0103m&#8221;. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4797,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[40,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4680","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-su-kien","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4680","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4680"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4680\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5219,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4680\/revisions\/5219"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4797"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4680"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4680"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4680"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}